{"id":"cc21d215609a3083","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-incomplete-ce-nonbasis.md","title":"不完全 c.e. 度不是有效闭类的基","display":"thm-incomplete-ce-nonbasis — 不完全 c.e. 度不是有效闭类的基","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-incomplete-ce-nonbasis","aliases":["20-thm-incomplete-ce-nonbasis"],"display":"thm-incomplete-ce-nonbasis — 不完全 c.e. 度不是有效闭类的基","chapter":"9","section":"9.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 9.3.4","source_printed_pages":[177],"source_pdf_pages":[209],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-basis]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-K]]","[[20-thm-simple-exists]]","[[20-df-effective-immune]]","[[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]","[[20-df-finite-array]]","[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]","[[20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-incomplete-ce-nonbasis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-incomplete-ce-nonbasis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-incomplete-ce-nonbasis — 不完全 c.e. 度不是有效闭类的基"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.3.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>177</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>209</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a03c2828834ee687\" href=\"?note=a03c2828834ee687\" title=\"20-df-basis\">20-df-basis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0ddc2f4aa380ea29\" href=\"?note=0ddc2f4aa380ea29\" title=\"20-thm-simple-exists\">20-thm-simple-exists</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b5b64991d8dc3e7d\" href=\"?note=b5b64991d8dc3e7d\" title=\"20-df-effective-immune\">20-df-effective-immune</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"680f7bcce5dddc10\" href=\"?note=680f7bcce5dddc10\" title=\"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound\">20-thm-hyperimmune-bound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"352368d98a9342b6\" href=\"?note=352368d98a9342b6\" title=\"20-df-finite-array\">20-df-finite-array</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b222e27484042250\" href=\"?note=b222e27484042250\" title=\"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence\">20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5fb6eea724c1b5f2\" href=\"?note=5fb6eea724c1b5f2\" title=\"20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper\">20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是 c.e. 集合族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是停机集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pi01Class}\">\\(\\operatorname{Pi01Class}\\)</span> 指 Cantor 空间中的有效闭类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是待构造的类。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a03c2828834ee687\" href=\"?note=a03c2828834ee687\" title=\"20-df-basis\">20-df-basis</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"0ddc2f4aa380ea29\" href=\"?note=0ddc2f4aa380ea29\" title=\"20-thm-simple-exists\">20-thm-simple-exists</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b5b64991d8dc3e7d\" href=\"?note=b5b64991d8dc3e7d\" title=\"20-df-effective-immune\">20-df-effective-immune</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"680f7bcce5dddc10\" href=\"?note=680f7bcce5dddc10\" title=\"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound\">20-thm-hyperimmune-bound</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"352368d98a9342b6\" href=\"?note=352368d98a9342b6\" title=\"20-df-finite-array\">20-df-finite-array</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"b222e27484042250\" href=\"?note=b222e27484042250\" title=\"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence\">20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"5fb6eea724c1b5f2\" href=\"?note=5fb6eea724c1b5f2\" title=\"20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper\">20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}incomplete-ce-nonbasis}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\forall D\\in\\mathcal E\\ (D&lt;_TK\\Rightarrow\\forall X\\in\\mathcal C\\ X\\not\\le_TD)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}incomplete-ce-nonbasis}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\forall D\\in\\mathcal E\\ (D&lt;_TK\\Rightarrow\\forall X\\in\\mathcal C\\ X\\not\\le_TD)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取本书的 Post 简单集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\omega\\setminus A\">\\(B=\\omega\\setminus A\\)</span>。已补齐的构造给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 有效免疫，经界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(e)=2e+1\">\\(b(e)=2e+1\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B(n)\\le2n\">\\(p_B(n)\\le2n\\)</span>。超免疫主函数表征的反方向提供一个可计算、不交、每列有限非空的强数组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>，各列都击中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\{X\\subseteq\\omega:X\\cap A=\\varnothing\\land\\forall n\\ X\\cap F_n\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C=\\{X\\subseteq\\omega:X\\cap A=\\varnothing\\land\\forall n\\ X\\cap F_n\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其补类可有效枚举为基本柱：看到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in A\">\\(y\\in A\\)</span> 时排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(y)=1\">\\(X(y)=1\\)</span>；每个完整有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n\">\\(F_n\\)</span> 排除在这些坐标全为零的模式。后一模式是一个可计算有限柱并，因此补类为有效开类；有效闭类树表示定理给可计算树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 本身属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>，故非空。由于各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n\">\\(F_n\\)</span> 不交，任何成员 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 都无限。</p>\n<p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的无限子集，继承有效免疫界。如果某个不完全 c.e. 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，有效免疫集的 c.e. 上界定理就给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\equiv_TK\">\\(D\\equiv_TK\\)</span>，矛盾。这证明展示式的稍强版本，特别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 无不完全 c.e. 度的成员，故这些度不是基。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 177 / PDF 209；补集横线在 PDF 文本抽取中丢失，因此所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 的方向按该构造及页面语义校正。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-basis","status":"resolved","id":"a03c2828834ee687","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-basis]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-simple-exists","status":"resolved","id":"0ddc2f4aa380ea29","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-simple-exists]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-effective-immune","status":"resolved","id":"b5b64991d8dc3e7d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","exc